category: Libs
requires: libgnutls-devel libnettle-devel libradcli10 libradcli2-devel pkg-config libradcli2-devel
sdesc: "Simple RADIUS client library (development)"
ldesc: "The radcli library is a library for writing RADIUS Clients. The library's
approach is to allow writing RADIUS-aware application in less than 50 lines of
C code. It was based originally on freeradius-client and radiusclient-ng and
is source compatible with them."
external-source: radcli

